WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.813 --> 00:00:09.315
Welcome to Peacock’s Love Island USA

00:00:09.315 --> 00:00:11.651
headquarters, where we take the dress code

00:00:11.651 --> 00:00:12.986
very seriously.

00:00:17.409 --> 00:00:19.953
As you can see, we’re working hard to create

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.706
the biggest and best season ever!

00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:25.519
Let’s pop over for a quick chat, shall we?

00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:26.228
(Clears throat)

00:00:26.615 --> 00:00:29.076
Oi! Enough lounging around, you lot.

00:00:29.178 --> 00:00:30.054
Get to work!

00:00:34.361 --> 00:00:36.312
Date Team, we want more candles!

00:00:36.312 --> 00:00:38.606
More red-hot romance, people!

00:00:45.696 --> 00:00:49.408
Wardrobe Team, we want less from you - a lot less.

00:00:49.408 --> 00:00:50.826
Fire up the shrinking machine!

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:57.774
Challenge Team, let’s go big this season.

00:00:57.839 --> 00:00:59.966
Come on! I mean really big!

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.529
That’s more like it!

00:01:04.529 --> 00:01:07.240
It’s hard work, but someone has to do it!

00:01:09.017 --> 00:01:11.478
Hold on to your bikini strings, America!

00:01:12.388 --> 00:01:14.432
Your summer of love is back!

00:01:21.263 --> 00:01:22.640
I think you’ve had enough there, mate.

